Original browser game, characters, maps, pixel artwork and synthesised audio.
The project uses the repository's Apache License 2.0.

Ghosts 'n Goblins is a historical gameplay inspiration, associated with Capcom.
No original game code, ROMs, maps, sprites, fonts or audio samples are included.
This independent game is not affiliated with or endorsed by Capcom.

QSOLKCB/ARCADE informed the buildless distribution, fixed-step simulation,
forgiving mode, and Pages deployment approach. Runtime code and assets here
were authored for GnG. IAOpen, Z.Corp and Throwafit are fictional satire.
